   fridge-water.html and the landing page index.html.

2. CONTENT: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International, CC BY 4.0
   (LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)
   Everything written or recorded: the script, narration text and audio,
   evidence notes, research agenda and prompts, test plan, protocols, CSV
   templates and the animation artwork. Reuse it, change it and share it,
   including commercially, as long as you credit "Fridge water project" with a
